// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2018-02-09 | Modified: 2022-01-07
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1218.007, command-and-control, T1105
// Description: Detects suspicious msiexec process starts with web addresses as parameter
// False positives:
//   - False positives depend on scripts and administrative tools used in the monitored environment
// References:
//   - https://blog.trendmicro.com/trendlabs-security-intelligence/attack-using-windows-installer-msiexec-exe-leads-lokibot/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_msiexec_web_install.yml
